---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Travel Tips - China Starter Guide" lang="en">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Travel Tips</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600  ">
      Practical advice to make your China trip smoother, safer, and more enjoyable.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  ">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Before You Arrive</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600  ">
          <li>Apply for a visa at least 1 month in advance</li>
          <li>Download a VPN before arriving (Google services are blocked)</li>
          <li>Notify your bank about international travel</li>
          <li>Get travel insurance that covers China</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  ">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Internet & Connectivity</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600  ">
          <li>Get a local SIM card at the airport (Unicom or Mobile)</li>
          <li>Free WiFi is available in most cafes and hotels</li>
          <li>WeChat is essential — locals use it for everything</li>
          <li>Google Maps doesn't work; use Baidu Maps or Amap</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  ">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Health & Safety</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600  ">
          <li>Tap water is not drinkable — buy bottled water</li>
          <li>Air quality varies; check AQI apps on smoggy days</li>
          <li>Carry toilet paper and hand sanitizer</li>
          <li>Street food is generally safe if it's busy and freshly cooked</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  ">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Cultural Etiquette</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600  ">
          <li>Learn basic phrases: "ni hao" (hello), "xie xie" (thank you)</li>
          <li>Tipping is not expected in restaurants</li>
          <li>Bargaining is normal at markets, not in malls</li>
          <li>Don't stick chopsticks upright in rice (funeral symbol)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>